    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.poster.avif?t=1745429966\" width=560 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.webm?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>HATMAN</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/d5118a41de6557a534d84cc276cdcd42.avif?t=1745429966\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enter the whimsical world of HATMAN, a 2D pixel art adventure where humor meets dark twists.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art:</strong> No asset flips, all art, music and code is produced by the developer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Full Steam Achievements integration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full control:</strong> Xbox controller/Keyboard and mouse are fully supported.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and Upgrade Weapons</strong>: Equip yourself with an array of powerful gear to tackle enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Gold</strong>: Amass a fortune while journeying through four expansive worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Mortal Combat</strong>: Face off against formidable bosses with challenging combat mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Characters</strong>: Meet a cast of quirky characters that bring levity to your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Challenges</strong>: Discover hidden secrets and take on various challenges along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/632162a9f25e3457c9c9e4b3275b0681.poster.avif?t=1745429966\" width=560 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/632162a9f25e3457c9c9e4b3275b0681.webm?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/632162a9f25e3457c9c9e4b3275b0681.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Storyline:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the four enchanted hats to your homeland while evading a mysterious bunny rabbit, who seems hell-bent on ruining your day. Can you overcome the obstacles and restore peace to your land?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HATMAN\u00a0</i>is sure to scratch that itch for an engaging, combat-filled platformer with a unique twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tails of Usagi:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm of pixels and sprites so bright, Where HATMAN embarks on his daring flight, Through four vibrant worlds, his quest unfolds, For stolen hats, his journey bold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies lurk with a cunning grin, And the shadows of a stalker, thin. But HATMAN\u2019s heart, both brave and true, Will guide him through each perilous hue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every leap and every bound, In search of hats, new friends are found. Through darkened twists and looming fright, HATMAN\u2019s courage shines the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So join this tale, this epic quest, Where bravery and hope are put to test. For in each pixel, a story\u2019s spun, Of HATMAN\u2019s race till the journey's won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASH BUTTONS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 When everything else fails, mash buttons to wallop the bad guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/397dd11b6259e7ae9586710bb057e8cb.poster.avif?t=1745429966\" width=560 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/397dd11b6259e7ae9586710bb057e8cb.webm?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/397dd11b6259e7ae9586710bb057e8cb.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Solo Developer:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! My name is Ninjacostar, and I am thrilled to introduce myself as a solo developer working on my very first game, <i>HATMAN</i>, which will be available on Steam. This project has been an incredible adventure, full of challenges, learning experiences, and a lot of joy/pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating <i>HATMAN\u00a0</i>has been a dream come true. From conceptualizing the game mechanics to designing the characters and bringing the world of HATMAN to life, every step has been a labor of love. As a solo dev, I\u2019ve had the unique opportunity to pour my heart and soul into every pixel and line of code. It's been incredibly fulfilling to see my ideas take shape and become something tangible that I can share with all of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am deeply passionate about crafting a game that resonates with players, offering both fun and unexpected depth. The journey of developing <i>HATMAN\u00a0</i>has not only honed my skills but also brought a profound sense of satisfaction. I am eagerly looking forward to sharing <i>HATMAN\u00a0</i>with the world and can't wait to see how players will react to the adventure I've created. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being a part of this exciting chapter in my life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regards: The Ninjacostar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/66a1cb44f3c6f789bafe055ffd8240f9.poster.avif?t=1745429966\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/66a1cb44f3c6f789bafe055ffd8240f9.webm?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/66a1cb44f3c6f789bafe055ffd8240f9.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.poster.avif?t=1745429966\" width=560 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.webm?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/b3c519bb2e23fa17d4d1d9d1cd3fb425.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>HATMAN</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/d5118a41de6557a534d84cc276cdcd42.avif?t=1745429966\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enter the whimsical world of HATMAN, a 2D pixel art adventure where humor meets dark twists.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Art:</strong> No asset flips, all art, music and code is produced by the developer.</p></li></ul><ul clas