/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343720/extras/66a1cb44f3c6f789bafe055ffd8240f9.mp4?t=1745429966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
